745\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9StrongSubmodelRelation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9StrongSubmodelRelation}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}strong\\text{-}submodel\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9StrongSubmodelRelation}_S(M,N,\\mathcal K,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(\\mathcal K,R,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}strong\\text{-}submodel\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogic9StrongSubmodelRelation}_S(M,N,\\mathcal K,R)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel6StrongSubstructure}_S(\\mathcal K,R,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reused predicate also requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> to be a preorder on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> refining ordinary substructure; membership of one arbitrary pair in an unconstrained relation was insufficient.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-model6-strong-substructure.md","status":"resolved","id":"42bc0fb952ef6745","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_